  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Life; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 1,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nAn emergency tool for removing enchantments in a hurry. When a person drinks the elixir, he may choose up to 3 ongoing magical effects affecting him. The elixir attempts a magic skill check with an MSB of +10 to dispel the effects, as the Improved Counterspell feat.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Life sphere (Break Enchantment); <strong>Cost</strong> 500 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc115\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
